Suggests: python3-pytest
Description: Advanced Web & Network Vulnerability Assessment Framework
 ReconStrike is a professional-grade vulnerability scanner designed for
 penetration testers, security auditors, and DevSecOps teams. It performs
 comprehensive security assessments against web applications and network
 endpoints using 43 specialized scan modules.
 .
 Key features include:
  * 43 vulnerability scan modules covering OWASP Top 10 and beyond
  * Zero false positive architecture with baseline comparison
  * Concurrent multi-threaded crawler (5-10x faster)
  * WAF/CDN detection (Cloudflare, AWS WAF, Akamai, Imperva, etc.)
  * Technology stack fingerprinting
  * Adaptive Network Masking (ANM) with Tor, proxy pool, MAC rotation
  * OWASP Top 10 & PCI DSS v4.0 compliance mapping
  * Scan diffing to track remediation progress
  * HTML, PDF, and JSON report generation
  * CI/CD integration with exit codes based on severity thresholds
  * Authenticated scanning with auto-login support
